    simple_audio_cuda_q15_intermittent_device_failure_2026_11_26, 0, "2026-11-26 NVIDIA GB10 aarch64, seed /home/yoon/.cache/cargo-target-claude-cudagated-1126/release/simple: 7 runs, 4 pass (readback samples 16384 16384 0 -2048 as asserted), 2 cuda-audio-readback-failed, 1 cuda-audio-module-load-failed. Other sessions shared the GPU during the runs."

